@startuml
title UML-09 — Paquetes Mobile Expo

' --- Configuración visual (Skinparams) ---
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundcorner 24
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
skinparam NoteBorderColor #FBC02D
skinparam NoteFontColor #3E2723

' Estilos base para paquetes
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #1976D2
  BorderThickness 1.5
  FontColor #0D47A1
  FontSize 14
  StereotypeFontColor #37474F
  StereotypeFontSize 11
}

' --- Definición de paquetes con estereotipos (iconos) y colores por capa ---
package "app/ (Expo Router)" as ROUTES << (R, #A5D6A7) UI >> #F1F8E9
package "features/*/presentation" as PRES << (R, #A5D6A7) UI >> #F1F8E9
package "features/*/application" as APP << (A, #90CAF9) Application >> #E3F2FD
package "features/*/domain" as DOM << (D, #FFE082) Domain >> #FFF8E1
package "features/*/infrastructure" as INF << (I, #CE93D8) Infra >> #F3E5F5

package "shared/secure-storage" as SEC << (I, #CE93D8) Infra >> #F3E5F5
package "shared/http" as HTTP << (I, #CE93D8) Infra >> #F3E5F5

' --- Relaciones ---
ROUTES --> PRES
PRES --> APP
APP --> DOM
INF ..> DOM
INF --> HTTP
INF --> SEC

' --- Notas ---
note bottom
Refresh token en Expo SecureStore. 
No se encolan transacciones offline.
La caché de lectura debe mostrar estado stale y nunca confirma stock.
end note

' --- Leyenda ---
legend right
  **Leyenda de Arquitectura (Clean/Feature-first)**
  ----
  <color:#A5D6A7>■</color> **Presentation / UI**: Componentes, rutas y vistas.
  <color:#90CAF9>■</color> **Application**: Orquestación y estado local.
  <color:#FFE082>■</color> **Domain**: Entidades, tipos y lógica pura.
  <color:#CE93D8>■</color> **Infrastructure**: APIs, almacenamiento seguro, repositorios.
  ----
  **-->** Dependencia directa (Hacia adentro/Shared).
  **..>** Inversión de dependencias (Implementación).
endlegend

@enduml